cing as the spring keeps its energy. A good value for this is around 0.3 for a normal car, 0.5 for a race car.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/vehiclewheel3d\/dampingcompression","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dampingCompression"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/VehicleWheel3D\/dampingCompression"}}}